SUMMARY:African Rhythms Alumni Quintet
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. This band of longtime collaborators of pianist/composer Randy Weston (1926–2018) marks the centennial of his birth. Weston spent decades exploring the African roots of jazz\, and his "African Rhythms" group was the vehicle for that lifelong project.
